# This repo runs on Linux (ROS 2 Jazzy). Default every text file to LF so shell scripts and
# Python launched inside the container/lab laptop never carry CRLF (which breaks `bash` shebangs
# and `ros2 launch`). Windows-only helpers keep CRLF; binary assets are never EOL-converted.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only helper scripts.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary assets — must never be line-ending converted (would corrupt them).
*.pgm binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
